<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-EMV SHARES TO TRADE AFTER SPLIT JUNE 4.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-EMV SHARES TO TRADE AFTER SPLIT JUNE 4.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A split in the shares of EMV will become effective on June 4 and from that date every 100-kroon face value share will be split into 10 shares worth 10 kroons, the bourse said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>June 3 is the last day of trading before the share split comes into operation, it added.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
